  <item>
    <title>19.💃｜尽量让自己漂亮一点</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/692328b7cbba038b42ee79f6</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">692328b7cbba038b42ee79f6</guid>
    <pubDate>Sun, 23 Nov 2025 15:35:45 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>这一期我们聊聊打扮这件事，更好的感受自己。</span></p><span></span><p><span>“我们都有属于自己的努力方式，无论最终是否有所成就，只要为某事某物奋斗过就是最棒的！”</span></p><span></span><p><span>找到取悦自己的方式，你会发生原来人生还有这样的活法</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FvPVZwLsWcnGUWjflyGGrKYApRIr.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span>《一饭封神》、《晚酌的流派》、《最是烟火慰平生》推荐可以看看～</span></p><span></span><p><span>小红书🍠：</span><a href="https://www.xiaohongshu.com/user/profile/57f75d3a7fc5b87ea006f87b?xsec_token=YBx4fO4yo0Y0KGjowHjUl6RHfJ3Nkkx5cPYZ78GC3HQps=&amp;xsec_source=app_share&amp;xhsshare=CopyLink&amp;shareRedId=Nz1INzhJN0o9TUg3S0A3S0czOT1KPT1L&amp;apptime=1763911335&amp;share_id=b19d69d99dd04724ae89651fdbc9ca13" data-url="https://www.xiaohongshu.com/user/profile/57f75d3a7fc5b87ea006f87b?xsec_token=YBx4fO4yo0Y0KGjowHjUl6RHfJ3Nkkx5cPYZ78GC3HQps=&amp;xsec_source=app_share&amp;xhsshare=CopyLink&amp;shareRedId=Nz1INzhJN0o9TUg3S0A3S0czOT1KPT1L&amp;apptime=1763911335&amp;share_id=b19d69d99dd04724ae89651fdbc9ca13"><span>彩彩Cathy</span></a></p><span></span><p><span>微信💬：EACH1007</span></p>]]></description>
